  "releaseNotes": "- **Added `MasterServerTMNF`** for TrackMania Nations Forever, sharing requests with `MasterServerTMUF` through `MasterServerTMF`\n- **Renamed the `ManiaAPI.MasterServer.TMUF` namespace to `ManiaAPI.MasterServer.TMF`**. Update `using` directives\n- Added constructors with an application User-Agent to every client\n- Added `IDisposable` to `AggregatedMasterServerTMT`, disposing its master servers\n- Deprecated `MasterServerType`, `MasterServerTMUF.DefaultUnitedUrl`, and `MasterServerTMUF.DefaultNationsUrl`\n- Updated TmEssentials to 2.9.1",
